# mijnnaamisbas

Turborepo of three SvelteKit apps (`apps/bookmarks`, `apps/espresso`, `apps/tidal`) and `@mnb/*` packages. See `AGENTS.md` for the map. Read the `.instructions.md` in the app or package you are about to edit.

## Stack

- SvelteKit 2 and Svelte 5 runes: `$props()`, `$state()`, `$derived()`, `$effect()`
- TypeScript `strict`. Package manager is pnpm. Indent with tabs
- Custom CSS tokens in `packages/tokens`. There is no Tailwind
- Hygraph through `createHygraphClients` from `@mnb/hygraph`. Mistral through `@mnb/mistral`. TIDAL stays in `apps/tidal`

`DESIGN_SYSTEM.md` and `.github/copilot-instructions.md` describe a mint/pink theme and Tailwind. The code does not. Follow `packages/tokens/src/variables.css`.

## Non-negotiable

- Read and write data in `+page.server.ts` or `+server.ts` through a service in that app. Do not call Hygraph, Mistral, or TIDAL from a `.svelte` file
- Secrets only via `$env/dynamic/private` inside an app. Packages receive the key or env object as an argument. Never prefix a token with `PUBLIC_`
- A new external origin goes on the CSP `connect-src` list in `packages/auth/src/handle.ts`
- Colors, type, radius, shadow, and spacing come from tokens. The look is brutalist: black borders, off-white paper, hard offset shadows. Blue (`--mnb-color-secondary`) is a rare accent
- Shared UI components are `MNBName` from `@mnb/ui`. Root class is `mnb-name`. Every custom property starts with `--mnb-`
- Links inside the current app use `resolve()` from `$app/paths`. Links to another app are absolute URLs from `appUrls()`
- Validate with the app's `$lib/services/validation` and `CONSTANTS`. On invalid input return `fail(400)` and include the submitted fields
- Arrow functions for utilities. JSDoc on exported services and shared-component props
- Shared UI lives in `packages/ui`. Do not add a second kit under `src/lib/components/ui/`

## Before finishing

```bash
pnpm exec eslint --fix <changed-files...>
pnpm --filter @mnb/<app> check
```

For a full feature, audit, or bug, read the matching file in `.agents/`.
